    "description": "Russia launches biggest wave of strikes on Ukraine for weeks",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111723/russia-launches-biggest-wave-of-strikes-on-ukraine-for-weeks",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
