    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Embassy-in-Sri-Lanka-marks-80th-anniversary-of-Viet-Nam-s-Independence-Day-and-55-years-of-Viet-Nam-Sri-Lanka-diplomatic-relations/56-780599",
