    "description": "George Steuart turning 190: A phenomenal landmark",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/George-Steuart-turning-190-A-phenomenal-landmark/4-780618",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
