    "description": "Harsha\u2019s strategy for financing long-term credit for SMEs: Is it viable?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Harsha-s-strategy-for-financing-long-term-credit-for-SMEs-Is-it-viable/4-780619",
    "lang": "en",
