    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka\u2019s Ambeon Capital buys 6.8-pct of Ceylon Hotels Corporation\n\nECONOMYNEXT- Sri Lanka\u2019s Ambeon Capital said it had acquired a 6.8 percent stake of the ordinary voting shares of Ceylon Hotels Corporation PLC for 320 million rupees.\n\nAmbeon Holdings paid 26 rupees per share, the company said in a stock exchange filing.\n\nCeylon Hotels Corporation stock was trading down 60 cents at 32 rupees. (Colombo/Aug22/2025)"
