    "chunk_text": "Wickremesinghe had maintained that his wife met her own travel expenses and that no state funds were used.\n\nHowever, the Criminal Investigation Department of the police alleged that Wickremesinghe used government money for his travel on a private visit and that the state also paid his bodyguards.\n\nThis is the first time a former president has been arrested in Sri Lanka\u2019s history."
