    "description": "UNP releases Ranil\u2019s invitation letter in response to allegations over UK trip",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111743/unp-releases-ranils-invitation-letter-in-response-to-allegations-over-uk-trip-",
    "lang": "en",
