    "description": "President hits pause on Mannar: Will SL\u2019s present Govt. finally press play on real energy reform?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/President-hits-pause-on-Mannar-Will-SL-s-present-Govt-finally-press-play-on-real-energy-reform/4-780657",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
