    "description": "India says US trade negotiations are still going on as fresh tariffs loom",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111775/india-says-us-trade-negotiations-are-still-going-on-as-fresh-tariffs-loom",
    "lang": "en",
