    "description": "Drug shortage caused by past govt\u2019s tender irregularities - Health Minister",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111784/drug-shortage-caused-by-past-govts-tender-irregularities-health-minister",
    "lang": "en",
