    "description": "Exporting in new era: ESG reporting as strategic enabler for global market entry",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Exporting-in-new-era-ESG-reporting-as-strategic-enabler-for-global-market-entry/4-780688",
    "lang": "en",
