    "date_str": "2025-08-25",
    "description": "ITAK  Launches Half-day Hartal  in North-East Over Alleged Killing of Tamil Youth by Army and Excessive Military Presence Amidst Civilian Habitats.",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=86325",
