    "description": "CEAT to invest US$171mn in Sri Lanka OHT tyre and track plants",
    "url_metadata": "https://economynext.com/ceat-to-invest-us171mn-in-sri-lanka-oht-tyre-and-track-plants-238195/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "economynextcom",
