    "date_str": "2025-08-25",
    "description": "\u201cMoving towards dictatorship \u201c: - Opposition leaders issue statement on arrest of ex-President Ranil",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111818/moving-towards-dictatorship-opposition-leaders-issue-statement-on-arrest-of-ex-president-ranil",
    "lang": "en",
