    "description": "India will buy oil from where it gets \u2018the best deal\u2019 - envoy to Russia",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111819/india-will-buy-oil-from-where-it-gets-the-best-deal-envoy-to-russia",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
