    "description": "EXPLAINER \u2013 Sri Lanka\u2019s ex-president Wickremesinghe\u2019s unprecedented arrest",
    "url_metadata": "https://economynext.com/explainer-sri-lankas-ex-president-wickremesinghes-unprecedented-arrest-238212/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "economynextcom",
