    "description": "US suspends chikungunya vaccine Ixchiq over \u2018serious\u2019 side effects: Valneva",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111839/us-suspends-chikungunya-vaccine-ixchiq-over-serious-side-effects-valneva",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
