    "chunk_text": "In his address, the Chief Guest Dr. Jagath Wickramaratne, highlighted the vital role of professionals in nation-building, fostering innovation, and contributing to a knowledge-based economy.\n\nSpeaker of the Parliament of Sri Lanka Dr. Jagath Wickramaratne\n\nTreasury and Ministry of Finance Planning and Economic Development Secretary Dr. Harshana Suriyapperuma\n\nThe evening featured an impactful keynote address by the Treasury and Ministry of Finance Planning and Economic Development Secretary Dr. Harshana Suriyapperuma, who stressed the role of professionals in supporting the Government\u2019s efforts to develop the country.\n\nThe night concluded with dinner and fellowship, offering a valuable opportunity for professionals from various disciplines to connect while enjoying captivating performances from renowned singer Umariya Sinhawansa.\n\nThe following day was dedicated to the technical sessions, which brought together experts, policymakers, and professionals to deliberate on key areas vital to Sri Lanka\u2019s progress. The recommendations and insights from these sessions will serve as a valuable foundation for the OPA to develop policy papers and initiate ongoing discussions with the Government, ensuring that the outcomes of the conference have a sustained and practical impact.\n\nThe 38th Annual Conference and 4th National Apex Awards underscored the OPA\u2019s pivotal role as the umbrella body uniting Sri Lanka\u2019s professional community, dedicated to elevating professional standards and contributing meaningfully to the country\u2019s socio-economic transformation."
