    "chunk_text": "\u201cIn the spotlight will be Sohan Weerasinghe , the legendary singer/entertainer, with an irresistible stage presence; Mariazelle Goonetilleke, whose songs remain timeless; Lahiru Perera, the ultimate crowd-mover, bringing unstoppable energy; and Kavindi Kulasena, the new-age sensation with a voice that commands attention; and with Dominic Kellar as compere.\n\n\u201cBacking the singers will be the electrifying Redeemers Band, guaranteeing a performance that will keep hearts racing and feet moving all night long.\n\nYes, indeed, Gajaba Unity Fest 2025 is not only a night to celebrate life, music, and unity\u2014but, above all, it\u2019s a way of giving back to those who gave everything for us.\n\nYou could also contact: Rumesh (0777 188 485) or Thusitha (0714 417 378) for more details.\n\nWhither Meritocracy? Reimagining Grade 5 Scholarship Examination in Sri Lanka \u2013 II\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
