    "date_str": "2025-08-26",
    "description": "Milk is a basic need, though a luxury at present but meticulous supply chain can curb price",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Milk-is-a-basic-need-though-a-luxury-at-present-but-meticulous-supply-chain-can-curb-price/4-780763",
