    "description": "Prime Minister says Govt. remains committed to human rights, fostering harmony",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Prime-Minister-says-Govt-remains-committed-to-human-rights-fostering-harmony/56-780786",
    "lang": "en",
