    "description": "Donald Trump says likely to visit China this year or soon after",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111843/donald-trump-says-likely-to-visit-china-this-year-or-soon-after",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
