    "description": "First human case of flesh-eating screwworm parasite confirmed in US",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111847/first-human-case-of-flesh-eating-screwworm-parasite-confirmed-in-us",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
