    "description": "1 in 4 people lack access to safe drinking water: UN",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111865/1-in-4-people-lack-access-to-safe-drinking-water-un",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
