    "description": "FinTech Intel UK joins as Strategic Global Media Partner for Asia International Digital Economy and AI in Finance Summit 2025",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/FinTech-Intel-UK-joins-as-Strategic-Global-Media-Partner-for-Asia-International-Digital-Economy-and-AI-in-Finance-Summit-2025/34-780804",
