    "description": "Aggregating innovation: Sri Lanka FinTech Summit aims to spark digital economic renaissance",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Aggregating-innovation-Sri-Lanka-FinTech-Summit-aims-to-spark-digital-economic-renaissance/34-780805",
    "lang": "en",
