    "description": "Sri Lanka will become a $ 100 billion plus economy in 2025",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Sri-Lanka-will-become-a-100-billion-plus-economy-in-2025/4-780809",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
