    "chunk_text": "The MoU was signed by Rush Housing Director Zaid Ariff, Rush Holdings General Manager Irfan Rafeek, Aitken Spence Elevators CEO Chaminda Hindurangala, and General Manager Tharindu Krishantha. These elevator units will be manufactured at OTIS\u2019s state-of-the-art facility in Hangzhou, China, ensuring adherence to international safety and quality standards. Key contributors included OTIS India Sandeep Sahoo, Devendra Kumar, Aitken Spence Elevators Chaminda Hindurangala, Tharindu Krishantha, and Abdul Cader Marzook."
  },
