    "description": "Defence Forces must become one of the most professional in the world \u2013 President",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111885/defence-forces-must-become-one-of-the-most-professional-in-the-world-president",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
