    "description": "SC adjourns consideration of petitions challenging Sri Lanka\u2013India Digital ID MoU",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111903/sc-adjourns-consideration-of-petitions-challenging-sri-lankaindia-digital-id-mou",
    "lang": "en",
