    "md5": "ec1201b73660f208a73d4309b764c3a0",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1519,
    "chunk_text": "JXG honoured among Sri Lanka\u2019s most outstanding women friendly workplaces at Women Friendly Workplace Awards 2025\n\nJXG (Janashakthi Group) has been honoured as \u2018One of Sri Lanka\u2019s Most Outstanding Women Friendly Workplaces\u2019 at the SATYN Women Friendly Workplace Awards 2025, celebrating the Group\u2019s role as a champion for women in the workplace, embedding gender equity, inclusivity, and wellbeing into every layer of operations.\n\nThis honour recognizes JXG\u2019s\u00a0pioneering efforts in fostering a truly inclusive environment, surpassing compliance to create a culture where women feel safe, supported, and empowered to grow. Inclusive leadership at JXG assures diverse voices shape strategy and culture. Women make up 59% of JXG\u2019s workforce, significantly above the private-sector average of 35%, and hold key roles in senior management, proving that gender representation is not only a target but a lived reality.\n\nThe award also reaffirms the Group\u2019s holistic approach, of integrating women\u2019s wellbeing into every operational layer, from boardroom representation and leadership development to daily workplace experiences including flexibility, childcare support, and wellness initiatives.\n\nPrime Group makes history with Sri Lanka\u2019s first luxury real estate client experience initiative \u2018Prime Premier\u2019\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
