    "description": "Ranil\u2019s arrest, political ethics and seeing \u201cthis administration\u2019s true face\u201d",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Ranil-s-arrest-political-ethics-and-seeing-this-administration-s-true-face/4-780857",
