    "chunk_text": "While funding gaps and regulatory hurdles persist, Sri Lanka\u2019s startup scene shows resilience. The rise of digital adoption, a young tech-savvy population, and increasing foreign investments signal a promising future.\n\nThe National Institute of Business Management (NIBM), Sri Lanka\u2019s pioneering higher education institute, has embarked on an ambitious journey to reshape the nation\u2019s entrepreneurial future through NEO Ventures, an innovative initiative of the School of Computing and Engineering Division of NIBM. Positioned at the intersection of education, innovation, and industry collaboration, NEO Ventures is more than a startup program; it is a national movement designed to inspire, nurture, and launch the next generation of Sri Lankan entrepreneurs onto the global stage."
