    "description": "Govt. will extend its support to strengthen manufacturing industry, says President Dissanayake",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111933/govt-will-extend-its-support-to-strengthen-manufacturing-industry-says-president-dissanayake",
    "lang": "en",
