    "description": "Teacher recruitment exam once SC concludes hearing of four cases: PM",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111951/teacher-recruitment-exam-once-sc-concludes-hearing-of-four-cases-pm",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
