    "description": "Japan\u2019s trade negotiator cancels US visit over tariff deal snag",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111963/japans-trade-negotiator-cancels-us-visit-over-tariff-deal-snag",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
