    "description": "US Fed Governor Lisa Cook sues Trump over firing attempt",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/US-Fed-Governor-Lisa-Cook-sues-Trump-over-firing-attempt/56-780957",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
