    "description": "Ukraine\u2019s \u201cLargest\u201d naval ship sunk in Russia\u2019s first sea drone attack",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111976/ukraines-largest-naval-ship-sunk-in-russias-first-sea-drone-attack",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
