    "description": "Sri Lanka shipwreck artifacts to be displayed at US-funded exhibit",
    "url_metadata": "https://economynext.com/sri-lanka-shipwreck-artifacts-to-be-displayed-at-us-funded-exhibit-238638/",
    "lang": "en",
