    "description": "Former Minister Rajitha Senaratne remanded until Sep. 9",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111978/former-minister-rajitha-senaratne-remanded-until-sep-9",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
