    "description": "New Rs. 2,000 commemorative note presented to the President",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/111980/new-rs-2000-commemorative-note-presented-to-the-president-",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
