    "chunk_text": "Former State Minister Nimal Lanza remanded\n\nFormer State Minister Nimal Lanza, who was arrested today (29) after surrendering to the Kochchikade Police, has been remanded until September 12 by the Negombo Magistrate\u2019s Court."
