    "description": "\u201cReflections on the Life and Times of Lakshman Kadirgamar on\u00a0 the 20th Anniversary of His Death\u201d",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/reflections-on-the-life-and-times-of-lakshman-kadirgamar-on-the-20th-anniversary-of-his-death-2/",
    "lang": "en",
