    "description": "Air India flight returns to Delhi after \u2018fire indication\u2019 in engine",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112024/air-india-flight-returns-to-delhi-after-fire-indication-in-engine-aircraft-grounded-for-inspection",
