    "description": "Tom Puthiyamadam and Jayson Traxler share key insights to Grant Thornton\u2019s acquisition of Stax",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Tom-Puthiyamadam-and-Jayson-Traxler-share-key-insights-to-Grant-Thornton-s-acquisition-of-Stax/34-781041",
