    "description": "Colombo Uni. to host program on \u201cEmbodied Intelligence, Buddhist Meditation Practice, and AI Tech Entrepreneurship\u201d",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Colombo-Uni-to-host-program-on-Embodied-Intelligence-Buddhist-Meditation-Practice-and-AI-Tech-Entrepreneurship/34-781042",
