    "description": "Sri Lanka budget deficit down 36-pct, tax revenues up 28.2-pct",
    "url_metadata": "https://economynext.com/sri-lanka-budget-deficit-down-36-pct-tax-revenues-up-28-2-pct-238888/",
    "lang": "en",
