    "chunk_size_bytes": 725,
    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka\u2019s Millennium Housing Developers trading suspension deferred\n\nECONOMYNEXT \u2013 Trading in Sri Lanka\u2019s Millennium Housing Developers shares will not be suspended as of September 1, according to a stock exchange announcement.\n\n\u201cSince the company has requested a deferment from the SEC in terms of  Rule 7.5(d)(ii)A.12 of the CSE Listing Rules, the trading of the said security will not be suspended until further notice.\u201d\n\nThe company faced the trading suspension for non-compliance due to \u201cmatter ongoing concern in the Independent Auditor\u2019s Report in the Audited Financial Statements for the year ended 31st March 2023- Rule 7.5.\u201d\n\nThe stock was trading flat 20 cents at 7.40 rupees. (Colombo/Sep1/2025)"
