    "description": "\u201cThere is no longer a threat of war in the country\u201d - President Anura Kumara",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112067/there-is-no-longer-a-threat-of-war-in-the-country-president-anura-kumara-",
    "lang": "en",
