    "chunk_size_bytes": 1181,
    "chunk_text": "Weerasinghe currently serves as the Chief Financial Officer at Central Finance Company PLC. Since joining Central Finance in June 2019, she has held senior roles, including General Manager and Assistant General Manager \u2013 Internal Audit, before being appointed as CFO in December 2021. She had previously been in senior managerial positions as Head of Finance at Axis Bank Ltd. (Sri Lanka Branch) and Senior Manager \u2013 Assurance at Ernst & Young, Sri Lanka.\n\nDushan Virantha has over a decade of experience in strategic planning and data analytics within the financial services sector. He currently serves as Senior Assistant General Manager \u2013 Strategic Planning and Data Analytics at Central Finance Company PLC. His expertise includes strategic planning, developing strategic initiatives, performance management, data analytics and artificial intelligence, and risk management, with a proven track record of driving data-driven strategic initiatives and supporting business growth. He is a CFA Charterholder from the CFA Institute (USA), holds a BBA in Finance from the University of Colombo, and a Postgraduate Diploma in Marketing from the Sri Lanka Institute of Marketing."
