    "chunk_size_bytes": 625,
    "chunk_text": "The geo-identification of products is also planned. \u201cBy creating GI-based certification for Sri Lankan coconut products, exporters will be able to calculate stronger market formulae, secure international recognition, and carve out a premium position for Sri Lankan coconut on the global stage.\u201d\n\nSri Lanka can boost exports, strengthen food security, create long-term opportunities for rural communities and have positive GDP impact by expanding coconut cultivation and value-added industries in the north, Ranil De Saram CCCI Secretary General and Senior Partner at EY Sri Lanka was quoted as saying. (Colombo/Sep2/2025)"
