    "description": "Double-edged sword of modern alchemy: Quantitative Easing in focus",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/double-edged-sword-of-modern-alchemy-quantitative-easing-in-focus/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
