    "description": "Family, inheritance and identity: Can UNP and SJB reconcile?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Family-inheritance-and-identity-Can-UNP-and-SJB-reconcile/4-781161",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
