    "date_str": "2025-09-03",
    "description": "Sri Lankan banks, conglomerates hold ground despite weak country credit profile, says Fitch Ratings",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/sri-lankan-banks-conglomerates-hold-ground-despite-weak-county-credit-profile-says-fitch-ratings/",
    "lang": "en",
