    "description": "Negligent police officers must resign or be removed \u2013 President",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112147/negligent-police-officers-must-resign-or-be-removed-president",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1756917180.0,
