    "num": "islandlk-d3eb5b8a",
    "date_str": "2025-09-03",
    "description": "Saving Sri Lanka\u2019s rubber: Why CLSD must be tackled by RRISL without delay",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/saving-sri-lankas-rubber-why-clsd-must-be-tackled-by-rrisl-without-delay/",
