    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s SVAT abolition: Exporters call for urgent e-invoicing solution ahead of 1 Oct.",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Sri-Lanka-s-SVAT-abolition-Exporters-call-for-urgent-e-invoicing-solution-ahead-of-1-Oct/14-781221",
    "lang": "en",
