    "chunk_size_bytes": 1483,
    "chunk_text": "PBSS Group Chairman  Dr. Madura Gamanayake wins  Gold at Sri Lankan Entrepreneur of the Year Awards 2025\n\nBags National and Provincial Gold Award in Large Business Category\n\nPerfect Business Solution Services (PBSS Group) Founder and Group Managing Director Dr. Madura Gamanayake, was honoured with both the National and Provincial Gold Awards in the Large Business Category at the Sri Lankan Entrepreneur of the Year Awards 2025, held at Cinnamon Life \u2013 City of Dreams recently.\n\nCelebrating its 25th milestone year, widely regarded as one of the nation\u2019s most prestigious recognitions of entrepreneurial excellence, the awards highlight leaders who have built resilient businesses and contributed meaningfully to Sri Lanka\u2019s economic growth.\n\nReflecting on his recognition, Dr. Gamanayake said, \u201cThis recognition is a reminder that entrepreneurship is not only about building companies but about believing in the strength of our own people. I have always trusted in Sri Lankan talent and in their ability to deliver world-class results while understanding our market better than anyone else. That confidence in local expertise has allowed us to grow into a group with international reach, creating value at home while earning credibility abroad. For me, the greatest satisfaction is proving that success built on Sri Lankan skill and determination can stand alongside any global benchmark, while ensuring that the economic value of what we do remains within our country.\u201d"
  },
