    "chunk_text": "Sri Lanka\u2019s official reserves increase marginally in August\n\nSri Lanka\u2019s official reserve assets have increased marginally by 0.3% to USD 6.166 billion in August 2025, compared to USD 6.147 billion in July 2025, according to the Central Bank of Sri Lanka (CBSL)."
