    "description": "Sri Lanka and Italy sign MoU on political consultations mechanism",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112188/sri-lanka-and-italy-sign-mou-on-political-consultations-mechanism",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
