    "description": "Sri Lanka and Italy successfully conclude inaugural political consultations",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Sri-Lanka-and-Italy-successfully-conclude-inaugural-political-consultations/56-781275",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
