    "description": "India will continue to buy Russian oil despite US tariffs, finance minister says",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112212/india-will-continue-to-buy-russian-oil-despite-us-tariffs-finance-minister-says",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
