    "description": "Trump signs order rebranding Pentagon as the \u2018Department of War\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112216/trump-signs-order-rebranding-pentagon-as-the-department-of-war",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
