    "description": "Is the  JVP-led NPP Govt Weaponising the Law to Target Former President Ranil Wickremesinghe?Over his UK trip ?",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=86405",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dbsjeyarajcom",
    "time_ut": 1757172600.0,
