    "description": "Thondaman\u2019s role in aborting Premadasa impeachment and Speaker Mohamed\u2019s perfidy",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/thondamans-role-in-aborting-premadasa-impeachment-and-speaker-mohameds-perfidy/",
