    "description": "Infant among three killed in Russian attack that sets ablaze seat of Ukraine government",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112249/infant-among-three-killed-in-russian-attack-that-sets-ablaze-seat-of-ukraine-government",
    "lang": "en",
