    "description": "Is India a \u2018tariff king\u2019? Not really",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Is-India-a-tariff-king-Not-really/4-781320",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
