    "description": "Explosives found at abandoned H\u2019tota meth lab, suspected ICE chemicals in Tangalle",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Explosives-found-at-abandoned-H-tota-meth-lab-suspected-ICE-chemicals-in-Tangalle/56-781365",
