    "date_str": "2025-09-08",
    "description": "After issuing \u2018last warning\u2019 to Hamas, Trump eyes Gaza deal \u2018soon\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112262/after-issuing-last-warning-to-hamas-trump-eyes-gaza-deal-soon",
    "lang": "en",
