    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s Foreign Minister to deliver statement at 60th UNHRC session today",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112265/sri-lankas-foreign-minister-to-deliver-statement-at-60th-unhrc-session-today",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
