    "description": "At least 10 killed, several injured as Nepal youths clash with police during protest against social media ban",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112289/at-least-10-killed-several-injured-as-nepal-youths-clash-with-police-during-protest-against-social-media-ban",
